## Article

```catala
declaration scope A:
    context output x content integer
    output o content integer

scope A:
    definition x equals -1
    definition o equals 10
    definition o under condition x=0 consequence equals 20
```

When a value is forced for x, we are able to find the conflict. When its
default value is used there is no conflict.

